# Anthropic API key — used for AI chat features in the terminal. Deliberately
# NOT VITE_-prefixed: a VITE_ var ships in the client bundle, and this one
# must stay server-side only. Read by api/claude.js (Vercel serverless
# function) in prod and by vite.config.js's /api/claude proxy in dev — never
# by browser code directly. Also add this to the Vercel dashboard env vars.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# ExchangeRate-API key — used for metals pricing in the FX module
VITE_EXCHANGERATE_API_KEY=

# Equities/index quotes — checked in this order; the app shows realistic
# DEMO data (src/services/mockData.js) until one of these is set to a
# working key. FMP and Twelve Data were both tried and both gate ASX symbols
# + batch quotes behind a paid plan even with a real key — Polygon.io is the
# intended long-term source; add VITE_POLYGON_KEY once it arrives (Polygon
# fetch functions still need to be implemented in api.js at that point).
VITE_POLYGON_KEY=
VITE_TD_API_KEY=
VITE_FMP_API_KEY=

# Supabase — auth, user profiles, and data persistence
# Add both of these to the Vercel dashboard environment variables
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
